{"content_html": "<article class=\"level6 chunking-small type-Section has-history\" data-cite=\"EMC 1.01.010\" data-short-cite=\"1.01.010\" id=\"1.01.010\"><header><h6><span class=\"num\">1.01.010</span> <span class=\"name\">Adoption.</span></h6></header>\n<p>Pursuant to the provisions of RCW <span class=\"range\"><a class=\"cite ctx-RCW\" href=\"https://everett.municipal.codes/WA/RCW/35.21.500\" rel=\"external\">35.21.500</a> through <a class=\"cite ctx-RCW\" href=\"https://everett.municipal.codes/WA/RCW/35.21.570\" rel=\"external\">35.21.570</a></span>, there is adopted the “Everett Municipal Code,” as compiled, edited and published by Book Publishing Company, Seattle, Washington. <span class=\"note history\">(Ord. 354-75 § 1, 1975.)</span></p>\n</article>", "extraction_version": "municipal-codes-validation-1.2", "node_id": "url:https://everett.municipal.codes/EMC/1.01.010", "publisher_node_id": "dom:1.01.010", "record_id": "0c97d7ea1fcae6139f1edb0fc2260860af514cf4e5da37a8b00a8eaddf42e47d", "source_version": "standalone:11d029de6ea246e5cd7efa1d0bd3b117324777eb9ce697782eb12165938785ba", "sources": [{"locator": {"attribute": "id", "kind": "html-id", "value": "1.01.010"}, "raw_artifact_path": "raw/68072312db8eb594a55b15f73f6f746bbaeac0fba3a121ed7760f5b5705c51df.html", "raw_sha256": "68072312db8eb594a55b15f73f6f746bbaeac0fba3a121ed7760f5b5705c51df", "source_url": "https://everett.municipal.codes/EMC/1.01.010"}]}
